OL,3,GNEWSAWitness appeal after fatal M20
OL,4,Acrash and fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are appealing for witnesses
OL,7,Fafter a fatal crash on the M20 near
OL,8,FAshford.
OL,10,FA black Volkswagen Polo was travelling
OL,11,Fon the coastbound carriageway between
OL,12,Fjunction eight (Lenham) and junction
OL,13,Fnine (Ashford) shortly before 06:00
OL,14,FBST, when it left the motorway and went
OL,15,Fdown an embankment.
OL,17,FA fire at the scene was put out, police
OL,18,Fsaid, and Kent Fire and Rescue Service
OL,19,Fsaid it had sent three fire engines and
OL,20,Fa technical rescue unit.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
